2 CONT '''     Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de Clermont & Montpensier was born in March 1381. He married Marie du Berry''', daughter of John de Valois, Duke du Berry and Johanna d' Armagnac, '''on 24 June 1400 at Pa
2 CONC ris, Ile-de-France, France.2 Jean I, 4th Duke de Bourbon, Duke d'Auverge, Comte de Clermont & Montpensier died on 5 February 1434 at London, Middlesex, England, at age 52.'''2
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Marie du Berry''' b. 1367, d. Jun 1434
2 CONT '''Children'''	
