2 CONT Belgium
2 CONT
2 CONT Archduchess Margaret of Austria (German: Margaretha) (10 January 1480 – 1 December 1530) was the Governor of the Habsburg Netherlands (Landvogt) from 1507 to 1515 and from 1519 to 1530. She was the daughter of Maximilian I, Holy R
2 CONC oman Emperor, and Mary, Duchess of Burgundy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
