1 NAME Jean Philipe /de Bourbon/
2 GIVN Jean Philipe
2 _MARNM de Bourbon
2 NICK Fugitive French prince
2 NICK Raja of Shergar
2 NICK Count of Clermont-en-Beauvaisis
1 SEX M
