1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jacqueline de Bueil, Comtesse de Moret (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #220164, b. circa 1580, d. October 1651
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=4 Dec 2008
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jacqueline de Bueil, Comtesse de Moret was born circa 1580. (1) She was the daughter of Claude de Bueil, Seigneur de Courcillon and Catherine de Montcler. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died in October 1651 at Vardes, France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Jacqueline de Bueil, Comtesse de Moret gained the title of Comtesse de Moret. (1) She and Henri IV, Roi de France were associated circa 1606.
2 CONT
