2 TITL Marie de Guise
2 NOTE Mary of Guise (French: Marie de Guise; November 22, 1515 – June 11, 1560) was the Queen Consort of James V of Scotland and the mother of Mary, Queen of Scots. She was Regent, or Governor, of Scotland 1554–1560.
