2 CONT '''     Charles, Duke de Chevreuse was born on 17 February 1524 at Joinville, Val de Marne, Ile de France, France.1 He Archbishop of Reims. in 1546.1 He Bishop of Metz. in 1550.1 He Cardinal. in 1562.1 He died on 25 December 1574 
2 CONC at Avignon, Vaucluse, Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur, France, at age 50; Buried at Reims Cathedral.'''1
2 CONT Citations
