2 CONT https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/MCDP-8NH/jean-mallet-de-coupigny-vi-1505-1593
2 CONT
2 CONT > When Jean Mallet De Coupigny VI was born in 1505, in Rouen, Seine-Maritime, Upper Normandy, France, his father, Jacques Mallet De Coupigny, was 52 and his mother, Marguerite de Bourgogne, was 30. He married Marguerite De Heaulx 
2 CONC on 28 March 1529, in Rouen, Seine-Maritime, Upper Normandy, France. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 2 daughters. He died in 1593, in Preyssac-d'Excideuil, Dordogne, Aquitaine, France, at the age of 88, and was buried 
2 CONC in Chêne-Bougeries, Geneva, Switzerland.
