2 CONT Jacques of Savoy, 2nd Duke of Nemours (October 12, 1531 – June 15, 1585) became Duke of Nemours in 1533. Died june 15, 1585 https://gallica.bnf.fr/ark:/12148/btv1b10051830t?rk=21459;2
