2 CONC ice-sur-Laveron 1 and Gabrielle Mareuil. Wife of François de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier , mother of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier , it inspires Madame de La Fayette for his Princess of Montpensier .
