2 TITL Mary I, Queen of Scots 1542-1587 Wife of François II, roi de France; Henry Stewart, Lord Darnley and Sir James Hepburn, 1st & Last Duke of Orkney is your fourth cousin 13 times removed.
2 NOTE Mary I, Queen of Scots is your fourth cousin 13 times removed.  
