2 CONT
2 CONT Emigrated on account of religious persecution to Geneva, Switzerland (1558). Citizen of Geneva (4/29/1566). Member, Council of 200 (1594).
2 CONT
2 CONT Marchand-drapier et bonnetier à Rouen, marchand de draps à l'enseigne du "Cheval Noir".
2 CONT
2 CONT m1. 7/4/1558 to Jacquemine Favre, d/o Claude Favre
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Sara Mallet (1560-1562)
2 CONT
2 CONT m2. 12/28/1562 to Laure Sartoris, d/o Jean Leonard Sartoris (Quiers, in Piedmont)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Esaie Mallet (1563-1582). Citizen of Geneva.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Anne Mallet (1565-1630); m. 1593 to Pierre de St. Andre.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Judith Mallet (d. young)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Susanne Mallet
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Judith Mallet
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Elisabeth Mallet
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Esther Mallet
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Gabriel Mallet (4/12/1572-2/19/1651); m. 2/8/1597 to Judith Tremblay, d/o Louis Tremblay. Children: Yes.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Jacques Mallet (4/7/1575-4/2/1657); m. 4/1/1600 to Louise Varro, d/o Guillaume Varro. Member, Council of 200 (1619). Children: Yes.
2 CONT
