1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Voir [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henri_de_Montpensier '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier1 M, #113735
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=6 Jan 2009
2 CONT      Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier married Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse in 1597 at Rheims, Champagne, France.2,3
2 CONT      Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier gained the title of Duc de Montpensier.1 Child of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse 1.Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier+1 b. 15 Oct 1605, d. 4
2 CONC  Jun 1627 Citations 1.[S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 68. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succe
2 CONC ssion. 2.[S36] Hugh Montgomery-Massingberd, editor, Burke's Royal Families of the World, Volume 1: Europe & Latin America (London, U.K.: Burke's Peerage Ltd, 1977), page 84. Hereinafter cited as Burke's Royal Families of the World
2 CONC , Volume 1. 3.[S102] Roglo Geneweb Website, online <http://geneweb.inria.fr/roglo?lang=en>. Hereinafter cited as Roglo Geneweb Website.
