1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Henry_II,_Duke_of_Lorraine<br/>
2 CONT Henry II (November 8, 1563 – July 31, 1624), was Duke of Lorraine from 1608 until his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT  History and Family
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the son of Charles III, Duke of Lorraine and Claude of Valois. He married first to princess Catherine of Navarre, Duchess of Albret and sister of king Henry IV of France.
2 CONT
2 CONT With no issue from this union, he married for the second time to Margerita Gonzaga, with whom he had two daughters, both married to cousins:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Nicolette (1608–1657), married Charles IV, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT *Claude (1612–1648), married Nicholas II, Duke of Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry was succeeded by his [https://www.geni.com/people/Fran%C3%A7ois-II-de-Lorraine-comte-de-Vaud%C3%A9mont/6000000003320572226 younger brother].
