1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *Maximilian I Kurfürst von Bayern was born on 17 April 1573.3 He was the son of Wilhelm V Herzog von Bayern and René de Lorraine.2 He married, firstly, Elizabeth de Lorraine, daughter of Charles III, Duc de Lorrain
2 CONC e and Claude de Valois, Princesse de France, in 1595. He married, secondly, Maria Anna Erzherzögin von Österreich, daughter of Ferdinand II von Österreich, Holy Roman Emperor and Maria-Anna Prinzessin von Bayern, on 15 July 1635 a
2 CONC t Vienna, Austria.3 He died on 27 September 1651 at age 78.3
