2 CONT Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #26, b. 1641, d. 27 May 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart was born in 1641 at Tonnay-Charente, France. (1) She was the daughter of Gabriel de Rochechouart, Duc de Mortemart and Diane de Grandseigne. (1) She married Louis Henri de Pardaillan de Gondrin, 
2 CONC Marquis de Montespan. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 27 May 1707 at Bourbon-l'Archambault, France. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      As a result of her marriage, Françoise Athénaïs de Rochechouart was styled as Marquise de Montespan. (3) She and Louis XIV, Roi de France were associated between 1668 and 1677. (1)
2 CONT
