1 NAME George Gordon, 2nd Marquess of Huntly
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1592
2 PLAC Huntly Castle, 
2 ADDR
3 CITY Huntly
3 CTRY Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 MAR 1648
