2 CONT Infanta Isabella Clara Eugenia of Spain (12 August 1566 – 1 December 1633) was co-sovereign of the Spanish Netherlands in the Low Countries and the north of modern France, together with her husband Albert of Austria. In some sourc
2 CONC es, she is referred to as Clara Isabella Eugenia.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
