2 CONT      Catalina Micaela von Habsburg was born on 10 October 1567 at Segovia, Spain. (1) She was the daughter of Felipe II von Habsburg, Rey de España and Elizabeth de Valois, Princesse de France. (1) She married Carlo Emanuele I, Du
