2 CONT Don Phelippes, by Gratia of God, King of Castile and Leon, of Arragon, the Two Sicilies, of Hierusalem, Portugal, Navarre, Granada, Toledo, Valentia, Galicia, Majorca, Seville , Sardinia, Cordoue, Corsica, Murcia, Jaen, the Algarv
