2 CONT
2 CONT Count Peter Ernst von Mansfeld 	Governors of the Habsburg Netherlands
2 CONT
2 CONT 1594–1595 	Succeeded by
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro Henriquez de Acevedo, Count of Fuentes
2 CONT
