1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.thepeerage.com/p11445.htm#i114443 thepeerage...] ; [http://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaston_de_France fr.wikipedia...] ; [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gaston,_Duke_of_Orl%C3%A9ans en.wikipedia...] ; 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans was born on 25 April 1608 at Fontainebleau, Île-de-France, France.1  He was the son of Henri IV, Roi de France and Marie de Medici.1  He married, firstly, Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensi
2 CONC er, daughter of Henri de Bourbon, Duc de Montpensier and Henriette Catherine de Joyeuse, on 6 August 1626 at Nantes, Bretagne, France.1 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, secondly, Marguerite de Lorraine, daughter of François II, Duc de Lorraine and Christine Gräfin von Salm, on 31 January 1632 at Nancy, France.1,3 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 2 February 1660 at age 51 at Blois, Berri, France.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans was a member of the House of Bourbon. He gained the title of Duc d'Orléans.4
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Jean-Baptiste Gaston, Duc d'Orléans and Marie de Bourbon, Duchesse de Montpensier
