1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Emanuel of Savoy (Don) Dates of existence Birth place Annecy Date of birth 1598 Place of death I went Death date 1652 Noble title First Marquis of Andorno Biography / History Born in Annecy in 1598 from an illicit 
2 CONC relationship between Duke Carlo Emanuele I and a Savoyard named Louise de Duyn, Don Emanuel was half-brother of the founder of the Daughters of Mary of Oropa and of the legitimate princes who perpetuated the Savoy dynasty in the t
2 CONC umultuous seventeenth century. The Marquisate of Andorno was created in 1621 precisely for Don Emanuel who first took the title and kept it until his death in 1652. He was buried in the parish church of Andorno Micca without honor
2 CONC s and without pomp. The "Don" does not indicate his belonging to the clergy: it is an honorary title that stands for "lord".
