1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ben notes: The information about Philippe in the Mellott-Eastman family tree has some errors in it, either from typographical errors committed by the person who put together the tree online, or by the original LDS 
2 CONC source. He is listed as named Paul, and is also listed as son of Josias (an impossibility given that they are two years difference in age).
2 CONT
2 CONT Other sources do list a Paul Merlet as Gideon's brother.
2 CONT
