2 CONT
2 CONT Philip Wilhelm Kurfürst von der Pfalz (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #112072, b. 24 November 1615, d. 2 September 1690
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Mar 2007
2 CONT
2 CONT      Philip Wilhelm Kurfürst von der Pfalz was born on 24 November 1615.4 He was the son of Wolfgang Wilhelm Pfalzgraf von Neuburg and Magdalen Prinzessin von Bayern.2,3 He married, firstly, Anne Catherine Vasa, daughter of Sigism
2 CONC und III, King of Poland and Constance Erzherzogin von Österreich, in 1642.5 He married, secondly, Elisabeth Amalie Prinzessin von Hessen-Darmstadt, daughter of Georg II Landgraf von Hessen-Darmstadt and Sophie Eleanor von Sachsen,
2 CONC  in 1653.6 He died on 2 September 1690 at age 74.4
2 CONT
2 CONT      Philip Wilhelm Kurfürst von der Pfalz was a member of the House of Wittelsbach.7 He gained the title of Pfalzgraf von Neuburg. He succeeded to the title of Kurfürst von der Pfalz in 1685.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Philip Wilhelm Kurfürst von der Pfalz and Elisabeth Amalie Prinzessin von Hessen-Darmstadt
