2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Amadeus, Duke of Nemours
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Jeanne
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke of Nemours
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Élisabeth de Bourbon
2 CONT
2 CONT Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Jeanne, Duchess of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Françoise, Queen of Portugal
2 CONT
2 CONT House 	House of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Father 	Henri of Savoy
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother 	Anne de Lorraine
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 	12 April 1624(1624-04-12)
2 CONT
2 CONT Paris, France
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 	30 July 1652 (aged 28)
2 CONT
