2 CONT Jeanne Baptiste d'Albert de Luynes
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
2 CONT
2 CONT Jeanne Baptiste
2 CONT
2 CONT Countess of Verua
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse 	Joseph Ignace Scaglia, Count of Verua
2 CONT
2 CONT Detail
2 CONT
