1 NAME Henrietta Douglas, Countess of Annandale
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1633
2 PLAC Castle Drumlanrig, Dumfries-shire, Scotland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 JUN 1673
2 ADDR
3 CITY Drumlanrig
