1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == LADY KATHERINE DOUGLAS ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Evidence from the National Records of Scotland===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1657-1678: Legal papers following on bond by Sir William Ruthven of Dunglass and Lady Katherine Douglas, his spouse, to Robert Malpus and Margaret Ramsay, his spouse, assigned to George, Lord Ross. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.
2 CONC gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD206%2f6%2f35&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=william+ruthven&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1620&dt=1720&di=y National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Hall Family of Dunglass, East Lothian, refere
2 CONC nce GD206/6/35]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''A date of death has not been identified for Lady Catherine Douglas. However, she died before 24 August 1663, the date upon which her husband's eldest child by his second wife, Lady Elizabeth Sinclair, was registered at Oldhamst
2 CONC ocks in East Lothian, Scotland.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Lady Katherine Douglas married https://www.geni.com/people/William-Ruthven-of-Dunglass/6000000016623717714?through=6000000016623896030. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04paul/page/103/mode/1up
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT # [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04paul/page/103/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 103]
2 CONT # [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/qr/ruthven2.php Stirnet: Ruthven 2]
2 CONT # [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10968.htm#i109680  Darryl Lundy's Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://www.thepeerage.com/p10968.htm#i109680 BIOGRAPHICAL SUMMARY BY DARRYL LUNDY'S PEERAGE]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Catherine Douglas was born between 1633 and 1641. She was the daughter of William Douglas, 1st Marquess of Douglas and Lady Mary Gordon. She married Sir William Ruthven, son of Maj.-Gen. Sir John Ruthven and Lady Barbara L
2 CONC eslie, after 1648. From after 1648, her married name became Ruthven.'''
