1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hon. Catherine Hamilton was born in 1623.2 She was the daughter of Claud Hamilton, 2nd Lord Hamilton, Baron of Strabane and Lady Jean Gordon.1 She married, firstly, James Hamilton, son of Sir Frederick Hamilton and
2 CONC  Sidney Vaughan, in 1647.1 She married, secondly, Owen Wynne circa 1655.1,2 She married, thirdly, John Bingham after 1670 when Owen Wynne died.1 She died in 1670/71.2
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From circa 1655, her married name became Wynne.1 From after 1670/71, her married name became Bingham.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Hon. Catherine Hamilton and James Hamilton
2 CONT
2 CONT #Sidney Hamilton+3 b. 1648, d. 10 Jan 1685/86
2 CONT #Hannah Hamilton+3 b. 1651, d. 16 May 1733
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Hon. Catherine Hamilton and Owen Wynne
2 CONT #Lewis Wynne+2 b. 1667
2 CONT
