2 CONT '''According to Sir James Balfour Paul, Mary Leslie is the eldest daughter of John Leslie, sixth Earl of Rothes.[https://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/453/mode/1up The Scots Peerage, III, p. 451]'''
