1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Howard,_5th_Duke_of_Norfolk
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Howard, 5th Duke of Norfolk (9 March 1627 – 13 December 1677) was an English noble.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born to Henry Frederick Howard, 22nd Earl of Arundel and Lady Elizabeth Stuart. The dukedom of Norfolk was recreated and given to him in 1660. The 5th Duke was considered mentally deficient and never married. The duties of 
2 CONC Earl Marshal were exercised by his brother, Sir Henry Howard, who, in 1677, succeeded him as Duke. Another brother, Philip, became a Catholic cardinal.
1 FAMC @F6000000002491239221@
1 RFN geni:6000000002672170984
1 SUBM @S6000000000112880822@
1 OBJE
