1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charles_Weston,_3rd_Earl_of_Portland
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles Weston, 3rd Earl of Portland (19 May 1639 – 3 June 1665) was the only son and heir of the 2nd Earl of Portland and Lady Frances Stuart.
2 CONT
2 CONT He succeeded his father as Earl of Portland in 1663.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was killed in the Battle of Lowestoft. Since he never married to produce a direct heir, his title passed to his uncle, Thomas Weston.
