2 CONT
2 CONT Here is a postscript to the earlier discussion of Habsburg bastards.  N.B. that the remains no evidence of ANY after 1618 or before 1800.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Emperor Rudolf II (1552-1612), who never married, had 6 illegitimate children, all titled Markgraf or Markgraefin of Austria: Dorothea (a nun), Elizabeth (a nun), Karl (a soldier), Julius (born about 1586) Herr von Krummau who be
2 CONC came insane and died 1609 at Krummau.  The last two were by Euphemia von Rosenthal: '''Matthias''' who, in 1608, hoped to become a Cardinal; he didn't, joined the army and in 1618 married a "Sicilian princess", died in Germany in 
2 CONC 1626.  '''Charlotte''' died in Mechelen (now in Belgium) in 1662; in 1608 she married Francois Thomas d'Oizelet, Comte de Cantecroy.
2 CONT
