1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francesco IV Gonzaga
2 CONT
2 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT Francesco IV Gonzaga (Mantua, May 7, 1586 – Mantua, December 22, 1612), was Duke of Mantua and (as Francesco II) Duke of Montferrat between February 9 and December 22, 1612.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit]Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT He was the eldest son of Duke Vincenzo I and Eleonora de' Medici.
2 CONT
2 CONT On February 19, 1608 he married in Turin, Margaret of Savoy (1589 – 1655), daughter of Charles Emmanuel I, Duke of Savoy.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had three children :
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria (1609 – 1660); married 1627 Charles II of Gonzaga (1609 – 1631), Duke of Rethel en Nevers
2 CONT
2 CONT Ludovico (April 27, 1611 – August 3, 1612)
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleonora (September 12 – September 13, 1612)
2 CONT
2 CONT Because Francesco died without male heirs, he was succeeded by his brother Ferdinando.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova1 M, #164211, b. 7 May 1586, d. 22 August 1612
2 CONT
2 CONT Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Duca di Mantova|b. 7 May 1586\nd. 22 Aug 1612|p16422.htm#i164211|Vincenzo I Gonzaga, 4th Duca di Mantova|b. 21 Sep 1562\nd. 9 Feb 1612|p11205.htm#i112050|Eleonora de Medici|b. 28 Feb 1567\nd. 19 Sep 1611|
2 CONC p22026.htm#i220251|Guglielmo Gonzaga, 3rd Duca di Mantova|b. 1538\nd. 1587|p11204.htm#i112031|Eleonora Erzherzogin von Österreich|b. 1534\nd. 1594|p11203.htm#i112030|Francesco I. de Medici, Granduca di Toscana|b. 25 Mar 1541\nd. 1
2 CONC 9 Oct 1587|p11204.htm#i112038|Joanna Erzherzogin von Österreich|b. 24 Jan 1547\nd. 10 Apr 1578|p11204.htm#i112037|
2 CONT
