2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Margherita de Medici (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #222151, b. 31 May 1612, d. 6 February 1679
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=1 Dec 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=0.8%
2 CONT
2 CONT  Margherita de Medici was born on 31 May 1612 at Florence, Italy. (3) She was the daughter of Cosimo II de Medici, Granduca di Toscana and Maria Magdalena Erzherzogin von Österreich. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma, son of Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita Aldobrandini, on 11 October 1628 at Florence, Italy. (3) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 6 February 1679 at age 66 at Parma, Italy. (3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Margherita de Medici and Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma+1 b. 17 Sep 1630, d. 11 Dec 1694
