1 NOTE After the civil war parliment wouldn't have him as king. But as thing go there was a reformation and Charles was called back home from France to ascend the throne. He became King of England, Scotland and Ireland. His father, Chale
2 CONC s I was executed and lost his head at Whitehall jan 30, 1649 at the end of the English Civil War. During Charles rein the great fire of London occurred as well as the great plague.
