2 TITL Princess Elizabeth Stuart of Scotland
2 NOTE Elizabeth, Electress Palatine and Queen of Bohemia born Princess Elizabeth Stuart of Scotland ; 19 August 1596 – 13 February 1662 was the eldest daughter of James VI of Scots, I of England and Ireland and his Queen consort Anne of
3 CONC  Denmark. She was thus sister to Charles I of England and Scotland and cousin to Frederick III of Denmark. With the demise of the Stuart dynasty in 1714, her direct descendants, the Hanoverian rulers, succeeded to the British thro
3 CONC ne. 
3 CONT
