2 CONT      Carlo Gonzaga, Duc de Rethel was born in 1609.3 He was the son of Carlo I de Gonzaga, 8th Duca di Mantova and Catherine de Mayenne.2,3 He married Maria Gonzaga, Principessa di Mantova, daughter of Francesco IV Gonzaga, 5th Du
2 CONC ca di Mantova and Margherita di Savoia, Principessa di Savoia, on 25 December 1627.3 He died on 31 August 1631 at Cavriana.3
