2 CONT
2 CONT Marie Louise Gonzaga de Nevers (known in Poland as Ludwika Maria) was Queen consort to two Polish kings: Władysław IV, and Jan II Kazimierz. She was born 18 August 1611 in Paris (or Nevers) to Prince Charles Gonzaga and Catherine 
2 CONC de Guise, princess of the French province of Maine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Contents
2 CONT
2 CONT [hide]
2 CONT
