1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Zie [http://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Floris_Carel_van_Beieren-Schagen '''Wikipedia...''']
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00040760&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Floris Carel van Beieren van Schagen was the son of Diederik van Beieren van Schagen, Vrijheer van Oud- en Nieuw-Goudriaan, and Marie de Thiennes, Comtesse de Rumbeeck. Being a 'ritmeester' in the Dutch army, in December
2 CONC  1672 he was captured by the French army. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 29 April 1674 in 's-Gravenhage Floris Carel contracted to marry Jacoba Maria van Wassenaar van Warmond, Vrouwe van Drunen en Gansoyen, daughter of Jan van Wassenaar van Warmond and Isabella Maria van Haastrecht. They became the
2 CONC  parents of four children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 24 January 1676 Floris Carel bought the estate Schagen. In 1677 he became a major in a cavalry regiment, in 1684 Colonel and in 1694 general-major. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacoba Maria died on 9 August 1683 and was buried in Drunen. On 15 April 1693 Floris Carel married Honorine Francisca de Berghes, daughter of Eugène de Berghes, Comte de Grimberghe, and Florentine Margareta van Renesse. There was 
2 CONC no progeny in this marriage. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Floris Carel died on 22 May 1699. His widow died on 18 May 1706.
