2 CONT Edward Woodman, was baptized on 9 Oct 1574. He married Collet Mallet of Corsham on 30 Jun 1600. She was born about 1579 and died at Corsham on 5 Jul 1611. Edward married secondly, Edith (???). His will was proved 16 Jul 1654. The 
2 CONC children of Edward and Collet Mallet Woodman, all baptized at Corsham, were:
2 CONT
