2 CONT Louise Charlotte of Brandenburg (13 September 1617 – 28 August 1676), was a Duchess consort of Courland by marriage to Duke Jacob Kettler of Courland.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born to George William, Elector of Brandenburg and Elizabeth Charlotte of the Palatinate (1597–1660).
2 CONT
