1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Share a memory of Meinrad II von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.Karl Meinrad II Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was born on 1 November 1673 at Sigmaringen, Baden-Württemburg, Germany. He was the son of Maximilian I Pr
2 CONC inz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Marie Klara von Berg. He married Johanna von Montfort in 1700. He died in 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Meinrad II Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen was a member of the House of Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen. He gained the title of Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Karl Meinrad II Prinz von Hohenzollern-Sigmaringen and Johanna von Montfort
