2 CONT
2 CONT      Philippine Elisabeth d'Orléans was born on 18 December 1714 at Versailles, Île-de-France, France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Philippe II d'Orléans, Duc d'Orléans and Françoise Marie de Bourbon. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 21 May 1734 at age 19 at Bagnolet, France, from measles, unmarried. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Philippine Elisabeth d'Orléans was also known as Mademoiselle de Beaujolais. (1)
