2 CONT * Henderson, Thomas Finlayson (1898). "Stewart, Alexander (d.1701)". In Sidney Lee. Dictionary of National Biography. 54. London: Smith, Elder & Co.
2 CONT * [http://books.google.com.au/books?id=grI2AAAAIAAJ An Historical Account of the Senators of the College of Justice: From Its Institution in MDXXXII]; by George Brunton, David Haig; 1832; Page 411<br/>
