2 CONT ''Hon. Archibald Stuart of Dunearn, Fife''' (? - February 1688), Governor of Stirling Castle.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in 1669 Anna Henderson, daughter of Sir John Henderson, 5th of Fordell and wife Margaret Menteith, and had:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Charles Stuart (? - 1732), married Jean Hamilton, daughter of Alexander Hamilton (ancestor of Barons Hamilton) and had issue: James and Mary.
