1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir John Gordon, Baronet [S 1642] of Haddo</strong>, 1st son and heir, born about 1632; succeeded to the Baronetcy, 19 July 1644, which was, however, owing to his father's attainder, under forfeiture till the Restoration 
2 CONC in 1660. He married Mary, only daughter of Alexander (Forbes), 1st Lord Forbes of Pitsligo [S], by Jean, daughter of William (Keith), 5th Earl of Marischal [S]. He died s.p.m. 1665."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/cu31924092524382#page/n469/mode/2up Complete baronetage]; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. II; page 451
