2 CONT *3. Lady Catherine Hamilton [5] b. 1701, d. 22 Dec 1712
2 CONT *4. Lady Susan Hamilton [5] b. bt 1702 - 1712, d. 3 Jun 1755
2 CONT *5. James Hamilton, 5th Duke of Hamilton+[1] b. 5 Jan 1702/3, d. 2 Mar 1742/43
2 CONT *6. Lady Charlotte Hamilton [5] b. c 1707, d. 5 Feb 1777
2 CONT *7. Lord Anne Hamilton+[6] b. 12 Oct 1709, d. 25 Dec 1748
