2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Hamilton. here treated, is the daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/William-Douglas-Hamilton-1st-Earl-of-Selkirk/5260144264140120453?through=6000000020943290496 and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Ham
2 CONC ilton-3rd-Duchess-of-Hamilton/5260120766220057577?through=6000000020943290496. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/383/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 383]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Hamilton, here treated died childless on 6 December 1731, at Edinburgh in Midlothian, Scotland. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun07pauluoft/page/26/mode/1up The Scots Peerage
2 CONC  VII: 26]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Lady Margaret Hamilton, here treated, married https://www.geni.com/people/James-Maule-4th-Earl-of-Panmure/6000000002115929263?through=6000000020943290496. They were contracted to marry on 5 February 1687. [https://catalogue.nrs
2 CONC cotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD45%2f17%2f641&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=margaret+hamilton&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1700&di=n NRS: GD45/17/641]'''
2 CONT
