2 CONT                     1
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5 February 1687: Maul. James, Earle of Panmoor, and Lady Margaret Hamiltoun, daughter to Duke of Hamiltoun. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso34scotuoft/page/359/mode/1up Canongate Marriages: 359]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                     2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5 February 1687: Hamiltoun. Lady Margaret, daughter to my L. Duke of Hamiltoun, and James Maul, Earle of Panmoor m. [https://archive.org/details/scottishrecordso34scotuoft/page/222/mode/1up Canongate Marriages: 222]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
