2 CONC ound: none;" title="William Douglas, 1st Marquess of Douglas" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Douglas,_1st_Marquess_of_Douglas">William Douglas, 1st Marquess of Douglas</a>. Mary thus did not join her father when he wa
