2 CONT      Mary Farnese was born on 18 February 1615. She was the daughter of Rainuzzio I Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita Aldobrandini. She married Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena, son of Alfonso III d'Este, Duca di Modena and 
2 CONC Isabel di Savoia, on 16 January 1631. She died on 16 June 1646 at age 31.
