2 NICK The Great Dauphin
1 NAME Louis de France, le Grand Dauphin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1 NOV 1661
2 ADDR
3 CITY Fontainebleau
3 STAE Ile-de-France
3 CTRY France
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 APR 1711
2 PLAC Meudon
2 ADDR
