2 CONC rmand I de Bourbon, Prince de Conti, son of Armand de Bourbon, Prince de Conti and Anne Marie Martinozzi, on 16 January 1680 at Saint-Germain-en-Laye, Île-de-France, France. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 3 May 1739 at age 72 at Paris, France, without issue. (1)
