2 CONT
2 CONT Diana, Princess of Wales, was descended from four of King Charles II's illegitimate sons: the Dukes of Grafton, Richmond, St. Albans, and Monmouth (all by different mistresses of the King). Diana's son, Prince William of Wales, se
2 CONC cond in line to the British Throne, is likely to be the first monarch descended from Charles II.
2 CONT
