2 CONT
2 CONT      Maria d'Este, Principessa di Modena was born on 8 December 1644. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Francesco I d'Este, Duca di Modena and Mary Farnese. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Rainuzzio II Farnese, Duca di Parma, son of Odoardo Farnese, Duca di Parma and Margherita de Medici, on 1 October 1668. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 20 August 1684 at age 39. (1)
2 CONT
