2 CONT From his father's page on the Mellott-Eastman family tree:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.reidmellott.com/Genealogy/getperson.php?personID=P3281738676&tree=metree
2 CONT
2 CONT There are baptismal reccords there for their children on these dates: "September 17, 1645: Josias (Josue), son of Gedeon Merlette. The witnesses were Claude Marcy, Jean Martijn, Jeanne Martijn, and Clasinne Tertelim."
2 CONT
2 CONT From SHIP PASSENGER LISTS: NEW YORK AND NEW JERSEY (1600-1825), edited and indexed by Carl Boyer, 3rd (Self-Published: Newhall, CA, 1978), 
2 CONT
2 CONT p. 130. "October 12, 1662. In De Purmerlander Kerck Gedeon Merlitt, wife and four children, 15, 8, 6, and 4 years old." [The four sons were Josue or Josias; Poulus or Paul; Jean Pierre or John Peter; Abraham.]
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: NEW YORK (COLONY) CALENDAR OF COUNCIL MINUTES 1668-1783, Compiled by Berthold Fernow. (Harbor Hill Books, Harrison, N. Y., 1987). p. 37: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mar. 20, 1684 "Order granting the petition of Josias and Paulus Marlitt for a survey and division of their inherited land part of which has been sold to Paulus Richards." [This indicates that Gedeon Merlet had died prior to Mar. 2
2 CONC 0, 1684, because his two oldest sons had
2 CONT
2 CONT inherited his land.]
2 CONT
2 CONT From Bill Marlatt's Gideon Merlett Family Tree:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.malott.net/index.php?option=com_content&view=article&id=40&Itemid=54
2 CONT
2 CONT Josias [2] Merlet (Gedeon [1]) was born in Leiden, Holland 1645. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Peatt. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Josias Merlet and Sarah Peatt had the following child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. George [3] Merlet was born 1685.
