0 @N6000000002322342840@ NOTE Last of the line of Valois kings, Henry aided in the Huguenots Massacre and
1 CONT would see the wars between the Catholics and the Protestants continuing
1 CONT during his reign. In 1584, his youngest brother died, leaving Henry III of
