0 @N6000000002322342763@ NOTE King of Naples & Sicily, and as Philip II of Portugal 1598-1621. In contrast
1 CONT to his father, he pursued peace in western Europe, however, backing Austria
1 CONT in the Thirty Years' War. Prime minister Gomez de Sandoval y Rojas, duque de
1 CONT Lerma (1552?-1621), and later Lerma's son, Cristobol, duque de Uceda
