0 @N6000000002176686590@ NOTE Anne was so extremely grateful for the birth of her son, Louis IV, having been
1 CONT barren of children for the first 20 years of her marriage, that she named her
1 CONT son, Louis Dieudonne, meaning "gift of God". His regency was spared the usual
1 CONT beatings and abuse given French princes by kindly but mediocre tutors. His
1 CONT mother, however, became his main teacher and influence, though he was
1 CONT never able to reslove the tensions between the governing elete committed to
1 CONT efficiency and a society organized by rank, birth and privilege.
