0 @N6000000003178084596@ NOTE Married Phillipe who was her 1st cousin.  She had one son and three
1 CONT daughters.  The representation of the Royal Houses of Stuart, Tudor,Pl antagenet
1 CONT and Normandy is vested in the descendants of the Princess Henrietta,Du chess of
1 CONT Orleans, but being Roman Catholics they were excluded from the success ionto the
