0 @N6000000002322348001@ NOTE Spain was controlled by regency during the decade of his minority and
1 CONT alternately by French and Austrian factions. During his reign, Spain rapidly
1 CONT declined as an international power. He willed his throne to Philip of Anjou,
1 CONT the grandson of Louis XIV of France, thus precipitating the War of the
1 CONT Spanish Succession. This Hapsburg blood line to Charles, therefore, comes to
1 CONT an end. Enters Philip V, the first of the Bourbon family of Kings of Spain.
1 CONT Childless, this led to the dismembering of Spain's European possessions.
